# Image in the frame (HARD) — ALL images

**SIGNED 2026-09-09.** Same loop on every photo. This is the law for **all** of them.

## Law

1. Name the **heading** he said. That media only.
2. **Keep the locked frame.** Do not rebuild the box.
3. Use **one** recipe. Do not flip.

| He says / surface lock | Recipe |
|---|---|
| “fit inside the frame” · “whole photo” · “don’t crop” | `fit` · scale **100** |
| Open **Never slip in chair pose** yellow | `fit` · scale **100** · NEVER cover |
| Default · “fill” · image-led 50/50 · Home Stef · sock era desktop · Coperni tiles | `cover` · scale **100** · X/Y only |

**Open Chair Pose (HARD):** `fit` · **100**. Whole photo in the frame. Frame follows the file. **Never flip to cover.** That is how it broke.

**Open mobile 50/50s:** match Chair Pose size → `image_fit_mobile: fit` · **100**. Do not change Chair Pose to match them.

4. One pass. Screenshot **that** heading at 1440 + 390. Stop.

## The loop (forbidden)

```
❌ cover → too cropped → zoom → still wrong → fit → too short → new height → cover again
❌ Neighbor 50/50 because the photo looks similar
❌ contain + cream/pink pad
❌ New vh / aspect / 400px cap to “make it fit”
```

If it is still wrong: **ask which edge.** Keep the same recipe. Do not invent #4.

